{"duration": 148.7, "beats": [{"text": "Ton cerveau te fait perdre de l'argent.", "start": 0.06, "end": 1.8, "words": [{"w": "Ton", "s": 0.06, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "cerveau", "s": 0.26, "e": 0.6}, {"w": "te", "s": 0.64, "e": 0.74}, {"w": "fait", "s": 0.78, "e": 0.98}, {"w": "perdre", "s": 1.02, "e": 1.32}, {"w": "de", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.42}, {"w": "l'argent.", "s": 1.46, "e": 1.8}]}, {"text": "Et il le fait exprès.", "start": 2.22, "end": 3.22, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 2.22, "e": 2.26}, {"w": "il", "s": 2.28, "e": 2.36}, {"w": "le", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.52}, {"w": "fait", "s": 2.56, "e": 2.72}, {"w": "exprès.", "s": 2.78, "e": 3.22}]}, {"text": "Pendant des milliers d'années, il n'a appris qu'une chose : survivre.", "start": 4.26, "end": 7.38, "words": [{"w": "Pendant", "s": 4.26, "e": 4.46}, {"w": "des", "s": 4.5, "e": 4.619}, {"w": "milliers", "s": 4.74, "e": 5.0}, {"w": "d'années,", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.32}, {"w": "il", "s": 5.54, "e": 5.6}, {"w": "n'a", "s": 5.64, "e": 5.72}, {"w": "appris", "s": 5.78, "e": 5.98}, {"w": "qu'une", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.2}, {"w": "chose :", "s": 6.24, "e": 6.5}, {"w": "survivre.", "s": 6.92, "e": 7.38}]}, {"text": "Fuir le danger.", "start": 7.86, "end": 8.48, "words": [{"w": "Fuir", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.06}, {"w": "le", "s": 8.1, "e": 8.16}, {"w": "danger.", "s": 8.2, "e": 8.48}]}, {"text": "Suivre le groupe.", "start": 8.86, "end": 9.54, "words": [{"w": "Suivre", "s": 8.86, "e": 9.14}, {"w": "le", "s": 9.18, "e": 9.24}, {"w": "groupe.", "s": 9.28, "e": 9.54}]}, {"text": "Agir vite.", "start": 9.86, "end": 10.42, "words": [{"w": "Agir", "s": 9.86, "e": 10.1}, {"w": "vite.", "s": 10.16, "e": 10.42}]}, {"text": "Parfait dans la savane…", "start": 11.02, "end": 11.94, "words": [{"w": "Parfait", "s": 11.02, "e": 11.32}, {"w": "dans", "s": 11.34, "e": 11.42}, {"w": "la", "s": 11.46, "e": 11.54}, {"w": "savane…", "s": 11.58, "e": 11.94}]}, {"text": "catastrophique sur les marchés.", "start": 12.38, "end": 13.68, "words": [{"w": "catastrophique", "s": 12.38, "e": 13.02}, {"w": "sur", "s": 13.08, "e": 13.16}, {"w": "les", "s": 13.2, "e": 13.26}, {"w": "marchés.", "s": 13.3, "e": 13.68}]}, {"text": "Regarde.", "start": 14.54, "end": 14.86, "words": [{"w": "Regarde.", "s": 14.54, "e": 14.86}]}, {"text": "Quand tout le monde achète, il te pousse à acheter.", "start": 15.28, "end": 17.26, "words": [{"w": "Quand", "s": 15.28, "e": 15.42}, {"w": "tout", "s": 15.48, "e": 15.54}, {"w": "le", "s": 15.56, "e": 15.6}, {"w": "monde", "s": 15.62, "e": 15.74}, {"w": "achète,", "s": 15.8, "e": 16.12}, {"w": "il", "s": 16.32, "e": 16.42}, {"w": "te", "s": 16.46, "e": 16.62}, {"w": "pousse", "s": 16.68, "e": 16.86}, {"w": "à", "s": 16.9, "e": 16.94}, {"w": "acheter.", "s": 16.979, "e": 17.26}]}, {"text": "Au plus haut.", "start": 17.58, "end": 18.08, "words": [{"w": "Au", "s": 17.58, "e": 17.62}, {"w": "plus", "s": 17.72, "e": 17.86}, {"w": "haut.", "s": 17.88, "e": 18.08}]}, {"text": "Quand ça baisse, il espère : tu gardes ta perte, trop longtemps.", "start": 18.56, "end": 21.78, "words": [{"w": "Quand", "s": 18.56, "e": 18.66}, {"w": "ça", "s": 18.72, "e": 18.82}, {"w": "baisse,", "s": 18.86, "e": 19.16}, {"w": "il", "s": 19.38, "e": 19.44}, {"w": "espère :", "s": 19.5, "e": 19.86}, {"w": "tu", "s": 20.22, "e": 20.3}, {"w": "gardes", "s": 20.36, "e": 20.58}, {"w": "ta", "s": 20.62, "e": 20.74}, {"w": "perte,", "s": 20.78, "e": 21.22}, {"w": "trop", "s": 21.28, "e": 21.44}, {"w": "longtemps.", "s": 21.46, "e": 21.78}]}, {"text": "Quand ça monte, il a peur : tu revends ton gain, trop tôt.", "start": 22.38, "end": 25.4, "words": [{"w": "Quand", "s": 22.38, "e": 22.5}, {"w": "ça", "s": 22.56, "e": 22.62}, {"w": "monte,", "s": 22.7, "e": 22.92}, {"w": "il", "s": 23.12, "e": 23.18}, {"w": "a", "s": 23.22, "e": 23.3}, {"w": "peur :", "s": 23.36, "e": 23.62}, {"w": "tu", "s": 23.94, "e": 24.06}, {"w": "revends", "s": 24.12, "e": 24.36}, {"w": "ton", "s": 24.4, "e": 24.54}, {"w": "gain,", "s": 24.58, "e": 24.74}, {"w": "trop", "s": 25.02, "e": 25.22}, {"w": "tôt.", "s": 25.26, "e": 25.4}]}, {"text": "Et après une perte, il veut se venger : tu mises plus…", "start": 26.0, "end": 28.8, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 26.0, "e": 26.04}, {"w": "après", "s": 26.1, "e": 26.28}, {"w": "une", "s": 26.3, "e": 26.42}, {"w": "perte,", "s": 26.46, "e": 26.72}, {"w": "il", "s": 26.9, "e": 27.0}, {"w": "veut", "s": 27.02, "e": 27.14}, {"w": "se", "s": 27.18, "e": 27.32}, {"w": "venger :", "s": 27.38, "e": 27.7}, {"w": "tu", "s": 28.1, "e": 28.2}, {"w": "mises", "s": 28.26, "e": 28.46}, {"w": "plus…", "s": 28.5, "e": 28.8}]}, {"text": "tu perds plus.", "start": 29.1, "end": 29.9, "words": [{"w": "tu", "s": 29.1, "e": 29.16}, {"w": "perds", "s": 29.32, "e": 29.52}, {"w": "plus.", "s": 29.58, "e": 29.9}]}, {"text": "Ajoute ta journée : réunions, mails, trajets.", "start": 31.0, "end": 33.8, "words": [{"w": "Ajoute", "s": 31.0, "e": 31.22}, {"w": "ta", "s": 31.26, "e": 31.36}, {"w": "journée :", "s": 31.4, "e": 31.7}, {"w": "réunions,", "s": 32.14, "e": 32.6}, {"w": "mails,", "s": 32.86, "e": 33.14}, {"w": "trajets.", "s": 33.32, "e": 33.8}]}, {"text": "Le soir, ton cerveau a déjà pris des centaines de décisions.", "start": 34.18, "end": 36.96, "words": [{"w": "Le", "s": 34.18, "e": 34.3}, {"w": "soir,", "s": 34.34, "e": 34.64}, {"w": "ton", "s": 34.78, "e": 34.9}, {"w": "cerveau", "s": 34.94, "e": 35.18}, {"w": "a", "s": 35.22, "e": 35.26}, {"w": "déjà", "s": 35.3, "e": 35.52}, {"w": "pris", "s": 35.54, "e": 35.68}, {"w": "des", "s": 35.72, "e": 35.86}, {"w": "centaines", "s": 35.98, "e": 36.36}, {"w": "de", "s": 36.4, "e": 36.48}, {"w": "décisions.", "s": 36.52, "e": 36.96}]}, {"text": "Il est épuisé.", "start": 37.32, "end": 38.14, "words": [{"w": "Il", "s": 37.32, "e": 37.38}, {"w": "est", "s": 37.42, "e": 37.64}, {"w": "épuisé.", "s": 37.7, "e": 38.14}]}, {"text": "Et c'est là que tu voudrais trader ?", "start": 38.62, "end": 39.84, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 38.62, "e": 38.7}, {"w": "c'est", "s": 38.76, "e": 38.88}, {"w": "là", "s": 39.0, "e": 39.1}, {"w": "que", "s": 39.16, "e": 39.2}, {"w": "tu", "s": 39.24, "e": 39.32}, {"w": "voudrais", "s": 39.34, "e": 39.58}, {"w": "trader ?", "s": 39.62, "e": 39.84}]}, {"text": "Les meilleurs l'ont compris depuis longtemps.", "start": 41.14, "end": 42.66, "words": [{"w": "Les", "s": 41.14, "e": 41.22}, {"w": "meilleurs", "s": 41.26, "e": 41.56}, {"w": "l'ont", "s": 41.58, "e": 41.68}, {"w": "compris", "s": 41.72, "e": 41.96}, {"w": "depuis", "s": 42.0, "e": 42.22}, {"w": "longtemps.", "s": 42.3, "e": 42.66}]}, {"text": "Ils ne sont pas plus intelligents que toi.", "start": 43.08, "end": 44.42, "words": [{"w": "Ils", "s": 43.08, "e": 43.14}, {"w": "ne", "s": 43.16, "e": 43.22}, {"w": "sont", "s": 43.28, "e": 43.4}, {"w": "pas", "s": 43.44, "e": 43.56}, {"w": "plus", "s": 43.58, "e": 43.7}, {"w": "intelligents", "s": 43.74, "e": 44.14}, {"w": "que", "s": 44.16, "e": 44.22}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 44.26, "e": 44.42}]}, {"text": "Ils ont simplement retiré leur cerveau de l'équation.", "start": 45.3, "end": 47.5, "words": [{"w": "Ils", "s": 45.3, "e": 45.42}, {"w": "ont", "s": 45.44, "e": 45.58}, {"w": "simplement", "s": 45.66, "e": 46.1}, {"w": "retiré", "s": 46.16, "e": 46.5}, {"w": "leur", "s": 46.54, "e": 46.64}, {"w": "cerveau", "s": 46.7, "e": 46.96}, {"w": "de", "s": 46.98, "e": 47.02}, {"w": "l'équation.", "s": 47.04, "e": 47.5}]}, {"text": "Leur secret tient en une phrase : décider avant.", "start": 48.38, "end": 51.3, "words": [{"w": "Leur", "s": 48.38, "e": 48.48}, {"w": "secret", "s": 48.56, "e": 48.88}, {"w": "tient", "s": 48.92, "e": 49.1}, {"w": "en", "s": 49.16, "e": 49.26}, {"w": "une", "s": 49.34, "e": 49.46}, {"w": "phrase :", "s": 49.5, "e": 49.82}, {"w": "décider", "s": 50.34, "e": 50.96}, {"w": "avant.", "s": 51.06, "e": 51.3}]}, {"text": "À froid.", "start": 51.68, "end": 52.06, "words": [{"w": "À", "s": 51.68, "e": 51.7}, {"w": "froid.", "s": 51.8, "e": 52.06}]}, {"text": "Des règles écrites à l'avance : si tout est réuni, on agit.", "start": 52.62, "end": 55.7, "words": [{"w": "Des", "s": 52.62, "e": 52.7}, {"w": "règles", "s": 52.74, "e": 53.04}, {"w": "écrites", "s": 53.1, "e": 53.36}, {"w": "à", "s": 53.4, "e": 53.42}, {"w": "l'avance :", "s": 53.46, "e": 53.88}, {"w": "si", "s": 54.26, "e": 54.32}, {"w": "tout", "s": 54.42, "e": 54.56}, {"w": "est", "s": 54.58, "e": 54.66}, {"w": "réuni,", "s": 54.7, "e": 55.02}, {"w": "on", "s": 55.32, "e": 55.4}, {"w": "agit.", "s": 55.48, "e": 55.7}]}, {"text": "Sinon, on attend.", "start": 56.1, "end": 57.1, "words": [{"w": "Sinon,", "s": 56.1, "e": 56.38}, {"w": "on", "s": 56.68, "e": 56.78}, {"w": "attend.", "s": 56.84, "e": 57.1}]}, {"text": "Et la limite de perte est posée avant même d'entrer.", "start": 57.54, "end": 59.88, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 57.54, "e": 57.6}, {"w": "la", "s": 57.64, "e": 57.7}, {"w": "limite", "s": 57.74, "e": 57.98}, {"w": "de", "s": 58.02, "e": 58.08}, {"w": "perte", "s": 58.18, "e": 58.38}, {"w": "est", "s": 58.4, "e": 58.5}, {"w": "posée", "s": 58.54, "e": 58.86}, {"w": "avant", "s": 58.96, "e": 59.24}, {"w": "même", "s": 59.3, "e": 59.46}, {"w": "d'entrer.", "s": 59.5, "e": 59.88}]}, {"text": "Longtemps, cette discipline était réservée aux pros.", "start": 60.86, "end": 62.92, "words": [{"w": "Longtemps,", "s": 60.86, "e": 61.22}, {"w": "cette", "s": 61.42, "e": 61.56}, {"w": "discipline", "s": 61.58, "e": 61.96}, {"w": "était", "s": 62.0, "e": 62.14}, {"w": "réservée", "s": 62.18, "e": 62.54}, {"w": "aux", "s": 62.58, "e": 62.68}, {"w": "pros.", "s": 62.72, "e": 62.92}]}, {"text": "C'est exactement ce que Compound Capital a construit pour toi.", "start": 63.74, "end": 66.54, "words": [{"w": "C'est", "s": 63.74, "e": 63.92}, {"w": "exactement", "s": 63.98, "e": 64.62}, {"w": "ce", "s": 64.68, "e": 64.72}, {"w": "que", "s": 64.74, "e": 64.86}, {"w": "Compound", "s": 64.9, "e": 65.24}, {"w": "Capital", "s": 65.3, "e": 65.7}, {"w": "a", "s": 65.74, "e": 65.8}, {"w": "construit", "s": 65.84, "e": 66.16}, {"w": "pour", "s": 66.2, "e": 66.3}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 66.36, "e": 66.54}]}, {"text": "Un algorithme automatique sur l'euro-dollar, le marché le plus échangé au monde.", "start": 66.99, "end": 70.95, "words": [{"w": "Un", "s": 66.99, "e": 67.09}, {"w": "algorithme", "s": 67.17, "e": 67.59}, {"w": "automatique", "s": 67.61, "e": 68.09}, {"w": "sur", "s": 68.15, "e": 68.29}, {"w": "l'euro-dollar,", "s": 68.33, "e": 68.95}, {"w": "le", "s": 69.27, "e": 69.31}, {"w": "marché", "s": 69.39, "e": 69.67}, {"w": "le", "s": 69.71, "e": 69.75}, {"w": "plus", "s": 69.87, "e": 70.07}, {"w": "échangé", "s": 70.15, "e": 70.55}, {"w": "au", "s": 70.57, "e": 70.61}, {"w": "monde.", "s": 70.69, "e": 70.95}]}, {"text": "Un seul marché, étudié par cœur.", "start": 71.45, "end": 73.49, "words": [{"w": "Un", "s": 71.45, "e": 71.51}, {"w": "seul", "s": 71.59, "e": 71.73}, {"w": "marché,", "s": 71.77, "e": 72.11}, {"w": "étudié", "s": 72.47, "e": 72.95}, {"w": "par", "s": 72.99, "e": 73.11}, {"w": "cœur.", "s": 73.21, "e": 73.49}]}, {"text": "Il lit les chiffres, pas les rumeurs.", "start": 73.97, "end": 75.63, "words": [{"w": "Il", "s": 73.97, "e": 74.07}, {"w": "lit", "s": 74.11, "e": 74.19}, {"w": "les", "s": 74.23, "e": 74.35}, {"w": "chiffres,", "s": 74.43, "e": 74.77}, {"w": "pas", "s": 75.01, "e": 75.09}, {"w": "les", "s": 75.11, "e": 75.19}, {"w": "rumeurs.", "s": 75.23, "e": 75.63}]}, {"text": "Il applique ses règles sans émotion, du lundi au vendredi.", "start": 76.03, "end": 78.97, "words": [{"w": "Il", "s": 76.03, "e": 76.07}, {"w": "applique", "s": 76.13, "e": 76.37}, {"w": "ses", "s": 76.41, "e": 76.51}, {"w": "règles", "s": 76.55, "e": 76.83}, {"w": "sans", "s": 76.89, "e": 77.05}, {"w": "émotion,", "s": 77.11, "e": 77.55}, {"w": "du", "s": 77.83, "e": 77.91}, {"w": "lundi", "s": 77.97, "e": 78.39}, {"w": "au", "s": 78.43, "e": 78.47}, {"w": "vendredi.", "s": 78.53, "e": 78.97}]}, {"text": "Et toi, tu n'as rien à faire : pas de graphique à surveiller, pas de signal à suivre, rien à cliquer.", "start": 79.45, "end": 84.83, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 79.45, "e": 79.53}, {"w": "toi,", "s": 79.57, "e": 79.73}, {"w": "tu", "s": 80.11, "e": 80.17}, {"w": "n'as", "s": 80.21, "e": 80.33}, {"w": "rien", "s": 80.41, "e": 80.61}, {"w": "à", "s": 80.65, "e": 80.75}, {"w": "faire :", "s": 80.79, "e": 81.03}, {"w": "pas", "s": 81.45, "e": 81.53}, {"w": "de", "s": 81.57, "e": 81.61}, {"w": "graphique", "s": 81.63, "e": 81.95}, {"w": "à", "s": 81.99, "e": 82.03}, {"w": "surveiller,", "s": 82.07, "e": 82.51}, {"w": "pas", "s": 82.89, "e": 82.97}, {"w": "de", "s": 83.01, "e": 83.05}, {"w": "signal", "s": 83.11, "e": 83.35}, {"w": "à", "s": 83.39, "e": 83.47}, {"w": "suivre,", "s": 83.51, "e": 83.81}, {"w": "rien", "s": 84.17, "e": 84.39}, {"w": "à", "s": 84.43, "e": 84.49}, {"w": "cliquer.", "s": 84.51, "e": 84.83}]}, {"text": "Concrètement ?", "start": 85.75, "end": 86.19, "words": [{"w": "Concrètement ?", "s": 85.75, "e": 86.19}]}, {"text": "Tu ouvres un compte à ton nom, chez notre courtier partenaire.", "start": 86.73, "end": 89.21, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 86.73, "e": 86.79}, {"w": "ouvres", "s": 86.83, "e": 86.99}, {"w": "un", "s": 87.03, "e": 87.13}, {"w": "compte", "s": 87.15, "e": 87.33}, {"w": "à", "s": 87.37, "e": 87.47}, {"w": "ton", "s": 87.51, "e": 87.61}, {"w": "nom,", "s": 87.69, "e": 87.81}, {"w": "chez", "s": 87.97, "e": 88.07}, {"w": "notre", "s": 88.09, "e": 88.33}, {"w": "courtier", "s": 88.37, "e": 88.67}, {"w": "partenaire.", "s": 88.71, "e": 89.21}]}, {"text": "Tu y déposes ton capital.", "start": 89.63, "end": 90.75, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 89.63, "e": 89.69}, {"w": "y", "s": 89.73, "e": 89.79}, {"w": "déposes", "s": 89.83, "e": 90.13}, {"w": "ton", "s": 90.15, "e": 90.25}, {"w": "capital.", "s": 90.29, "e": 90.75}]}, {"text": "Tu demandes l'accès.", "start": 91.11, "end": 91.89, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 91.11, "e": 91.17}, {"w": "demandes", "s": 91.27, "e": 91.53}, {"w": "l'accès.", "s": 91.55, "e": 91.89}]}, {"text": "Et chaque position de l'algorithme se copie automatiquement chez toi.", "start": 92.35, "end": 95.45, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 92.35, "e": 92.45}, {"w": "chaque", "s": 92.53, "e": 92.73}, {"w": "position", "s": 92.77, "e": 93.17}, {"w": "de", "s": 93.19, "e": 93.25}, {"w": "l'algorithme", "s": 93.29, "e": 93.77}, {"w": "se", "s": 93.89, "e": 93.99}, {"w": "copie", "s": 94.03, "e": 94.25}, {"w": "automatiquement", "s": 94.41, "e": 95.07}, {"w": "chez", "s": 95.09, "e": 95.23}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 95.27, "e": 95.45}]}, {"text": "Ton argent ne quitte jamais ton compte : personne d'autre que toi ne peut le retirer.", "start": 96.41, "end": 100.19, "words": [{"w": "Ton", "s": 96.41, "e": 96.51}, {"w": "argent", "s": 96.59, "e": 96.79}, {"w": "ne", "s": 96.83, "e": 96.89}, {"w": "quitte", "s": 96.97, "e": 97.21}, {"w": "jamais", "s": 97.29, "e": 97.53}, {"w": "ton", "s": 97.57, "e": 97.71}, {"w": "compte :", "s": 97.75, "e": 97.99}, {"w": "personne", "s": 98.39, "e": 98.73}, {"w": "d'autre", "s": 98.77, "e": 99.03}, {"w": "que", "s": 99.07, "e": 99.21}, {"w": "toi", "s": 99.27, "e": 99.43}, {"w": "ne", "s": 99.47, "e": 99.53}, {"w": "peut", "s": 99.61, "e": 99.67}, {"w": "le", "s": 99.71, "e": 99.75}, {"w": "retirer.", "s": 99.79, "e": 100.19}]}, {"text": "Et tu peux tout arrêter, quand tu veux.", "start": 100.59, "end": 102.31, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 100.59, "e": 100.65}, {"w": "tu", "s": 100.69, "e": 100.73}, {"w": "peux", "s": 100.81, "e": 100.99}, {"w": "tout", "s": 101.03, "e": 101.19}, {"w": "arrêter,", "s": 101.25, "e": 101.57}, {"w": "quand", "s": 101.87, "e": 101.99}, {"w": "tu", "s": 102.03, "e": 102.11}, {"w": "veux.", "s": 102.19, "e": 102.31}]}, {"text": "Et nous, dans tout ça ?", "start": 103.23, "end": 104.03, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 103.23, "e": 103.29}, {"w": "nous,", "s": 103.35, "e": 103.45}, {"w": "dans", "s": 103.67, "e": 103.77}, {"w": "tout", "s": 103.79, "e": 103.89}, {"w": "ça ?", "s": 103.95, "e": 104.03}]}, {"text": "On n'est payés que sur les gains.", "start": 104.55, "end": 105.79, "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 104.55, "e": 104.61}, {"w": "n'est", "s": 104.65, "e": 104.77}, {"w": "payés", "s": 104.79, "e": 105.11}, {"w": "que", "s": 105.15, "e": 105.29}, {"w": "sur", "s": 105.33, "e": 105.45}, {"w": "les", "s": 105.49, "e": 105.59}, {"w": "gains.", "s": 105.63, "e": 105.79}]}, {"text": "Pas de gain, pas de commission.", "start": 106.17, "end": 107.49, "words": [{"w": "Pas", "s": 106.17, "e": 106.25}, {"w": "de", "s": 106.29, "e": 106.35}, {"w": "gain,", "s": 106.39, "e": 106.55}, {"w": "pas", "s": 106.87, "e": 106.93}, {"w": "de", "s": 106.97, "e": 107.01}, {"w": "commission.", "s": 107.05, "e": 107.49}]}, {"text": "Notre intérêt est simple : que ton compte progresse.", "start": 107.91, "end": 110.41, "words": [{"w": "Notre", "s": 107.91, "e": 108.07}, {"w": "intérêt", "s": 108.11, "e": 108.41}, {"w": "est", "s": 108.43, "e": 108.57}, {"w": "simple :", "s": 108.63, "e": 108.93}, {"w": "que", "s": 109.23, "e": 109.29}, {"w": "ton", "s": 109.37, "e": 109.45}, {"w": "compte", "s": 109.55, "e": 109.71}, {"w": "progresse.", "s": 109.83, "e": 110.41}]}, {"text": "Ici, pas de promesse en l'air, pas de capture d'écran.", "start": 111.35, "end": 113.83, "words": [{"w": "Ici,", "s": 111.35, "e": 111.67}, {"w": "pas", "s": 111.95, "e": 112.01}, {"w": "de", "s": 112.05, "e": 112.11}, {"w": "promesse", "s": 112.13, "e": 112.45}, {"w": "en", "s": 112.49, "e": 112.55}, {"w": "l'air,", "s": 112.59, "e": 112.81}, {"w": "pas", "s": 113.01, "e": 113.09}, {"w": "de", "s": 113.13, "e": 113.17}, {"w": "capture", "s": 113.21, "e": 113.49}, {"w": "d'écran.", "s": 113.51, "e": 113.83}]}, {"text": "Un historique en argent réel, vérifiable par n'importe qui, sur MyFxBook.", "start": 114.29, "end": 118.59, "words": [{"w": "Un", "s": 114.29, "e": 114.37}, {"w": "historique", "s": 114.39, "e": 114.79}, {"w": "en", "s": 114.83, "e": 114.91}, {"w": "argent", "s": 114.97, "e": 115.27}, {"w": "réel,", "s": 115.33, "e": 115.65}, {"w": "vérifiable", "s": 115.91, "e": 116.49}, {"w": "par", "s": 116.53, "e": 116.63}, {"w": "n'importe", "s": 116.73, "e": 117.15}, {"w": "qui,", "s": 117.25, "e": 117.37}, {"w": "sur", "s": 117.67, "e": 117.81}, {"w": "MyFxBook.", "s": 117.87, "e": 118.59}]}, {"text": "Pas besoin d'être trader pour le lire.", "start": 119.11, "end": 120.59, "words": [{"w": "Pas", "s": 119.11, "e": 119.21}, {"w": "besoin", "s": 119.23, "e": 119.45}, {"w": "d'être", "s": 119.49, "e": 119.73}, {"w": "trader", "s": 119.77, "e": 120.11}, {"w": "pour", "s": 120.13, "e": 120.23}, {"w": "le", "s": 120.25, "e": 120.33}, {"w": "lire.", "s": 120.37, "e": 120.59}]}, {"text": "Juste de vouloir comprendre.", "start": 120.99, "end": 122.29, "words": [{"w": "Juste", "s": 120.99, "e": 121.31}, {"w": "de", "s": 121.35, "e": 121.47}, {"w": "vouloir", "s": 121.49, "e": 121.75}, {"w": "comprendre.", "s": 121.83, "e": 122.29}]}, {"text": "C'est d'ailleurs pour ça que l'accès se fait sur demande : on préfère des gens qui ont compris…", "start": 122.79, "end": 126.49, "words": [{"w": "C'est", "s": 122.79, "e": 122.85}, {"w": "d'ailleurs", "s": 122.87, "e": 123.13}, {"w": "pour", "s": 123.17, "e": 123.33}, {"w": "ça", "s": 123.39, "e": 123.45}, {"w": "que", "s": 123.53, "e": 123.61}, {"w": "l'accès", "s": 123.65, "e": 123.89}, {"w": "se", "s": 123.93, "e": 124.03}, {"w": "fait", "s": 124.07, "e": 124.17}, {"w": "sur", "s": 124.23, "e": 124.37}, {"w": "demande :", "s": 124.41, "e": 124.75}, {"w": "on", "s": 125.13, "e": 125.19}, {"w": "préfère", "s": 125.23, "e": 125.53}, {"w": "des", "s": 125.55, "e": 125.65}, {"w": "gens", "s": 125.67, "e": 125.83}, {"w": "qui", "s": 125.85, "e": 125.93}, {"w": "ont", "s": 125.95, "e": 126.07}, {"w": "compris…", "s": 126.13, "e": 126.49}]}, {"text": "à des gens pressés.", "start": 126.85, "end": 127.57, "words": [{"w": "à", "s": 126.85, "e": 126.87}, {"w": "des", "s": 126.91, "e": 127.01}, {"w": "gens", "s": 127.03, "e": 127.17}, {"w": "pressés.", "s": 127.21, "e": 127.57}]}, {"text": "Alors imagine.", "start": 128.69, "end": 129.27, "words": [{"w": "Alors", "s": 128.69, "e": 128.85}, {"w": "imagine.", "s": 128.89, "e": 129.27}]}, {"text": "Tu sors de ta réunion.", "start": 129.75, "end": 130.71, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 129.75, "e": 129.81}, {"w": "sors", "s": 129.93, "e": 130.07}, {"w": "de", "s": 130.11, "e": 130.19}, {"w": "ta", "s": 130.21, "e": 130.29}, {"w": "réunion.", "s": 130.35, "e": 130.71}]}, {"text": "Tu ouvres ton téléphone.", "start": 131.07, "end": 132.05, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 131.07, "e": 131.15}, {"w": "ouvres", "s": 131.19, "e": 131.39}, {"w": "ton", "s": 131.43, "e": 131.51}, {"w": "téléphone.", "s": 131.57, "e": 132.05}]}, {"text": "Pendant que tu vivais ta journée, ton algorithme a suivi ses règles.", "start": 132.55, "end": 135.43, "words": [{"w": "Pendant", "s": 132.55, "e": 132.73}, {"w": "que", "s": 132.77, "e": 132.85}, {"w": "tu", "s": 132.89, "e": 132.97}, {"w": "vivais", "s": 133.01, "e": 133.21}, {"w": "ta", "s": 133.25, "e": 133.35}, {"w": "journée,", "s": 133.39, "e": 133.69}, {"w": "ton", "s": 133.99, "e": 134.11}, {"w": "algorithme", "s": 134.17, "e": 134.57}, {"w": "a", "s": 134.59, "e": 134.67}, {"w": "suivi", "s": 134.71, "e": 134.93}, {"w": "ses", "s": 134.989, "e": 135.11}, {"w": "règles.", "s": 135.149, "e": 135.43}]}, {"text": "Sans stress.", "start": 135.849, "end": 136.409, "words": [{"w": "Sans", "s": 135.849, "e": 135.97}, {"w": "stress.", "s": 136.05, "e": 136.409}]}, {"text": "Sans écran.", "start": 136.71, "end": 137.21, "words": [{"w": "Sans", "s": 136.71, "e": 136.87}, {"w": "écran.", "s": 136.93, "e": 137.21}]}, {"text": "Sans toi.", "start": 137.59, "end": 137.97, "words": [{"w": "Sans", "s": 137.59, "e": 137.75}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 137.79, "e": 137.97}]}, {"text": "Tu gardes ton travail.", "start": 138.55, "end": 139.53, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 138.55, "e": 138.61}, {"w": "gardes", "s": 138.69, "e": 138.95}, {"w": "ton", "s": 138.97, "e": 139.07}, {"w": "travail.", "s": 139.11, "e": 139.53}]}, {"text": "Il garde la discipline.", "start": 139.89, "end": 141.01, "words": [{"w": "Il", "s": 139.89, "e": 139.97}, {"w": "garde", "s": 140.09, "e": 140.37}, {"w": "la", "s": 140.41, "e": 140.49}, {"w": "discipline.", "s": 140.51, "e": 141.01}]}, {"text": "CTA", "start": 142.0, "end": 145.04, "words": [{"w": "Si", "s": 142.154, "e": 142.333}, {"w": "tu", "s": 142.333, "e": 142.512}, {"w": "souhaites", "s": 142.512, "e": 143.048}, {"w": "y", "s": 143.048, "e": 143.176}, {"w": "accéder,", "s": 143.176, "e": 143.61}, {"w": "commente", "s": 143.61, "e": 144.096}, {"w": "« Capital ».", "s": 144.096, "e": 144.53}], "speech_end": 144.53}, {"text": "Compound Capital.", "start": 145.54, "end": 146.48, "words": [{"w": "Compound", "s": 145.54, "e": 145.92}, {"w": "Capital.", "s": 145.98, "e": 146.48}]}, {"text": "Comprendre avant de décider.", "start": 146.96, "end": 148.48, "words": [{"w": "Comprendre", "s": 146.96, "e": 147.64}, {"w": "avant", "s": 147.72, "e": 147.92}, {"w": "de", "s": 147.96, "e": 148.02}, {"w": "décider.", "s": 148.06, "e": 148.48}]}]}